			title: "Level Ten"
			x: 30.75d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["35A51182375E77A6"]
			description: ["Sirius B is a white dwarf, a star's core left bare. Park in its orbit and build station ten."]
			icon: "grindless:warp_gate_casing"
			id: "31F75527A44532C5"
			rewards: [{ id: "58D087410E35981D", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [{ dimension: "grindless:sirius_b_orbit", id: "31E4AC2B068FF5EF", type: "dimension" }]
			title: "Sirius B"
			x: 32.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["31F75527A44532C5"]
			description: ["A white dwarf packs a Sun's mass into an Earth's volume. Light climbing out of its gravity loses energy, and that loss is what the instruments here measure."]
			icon: "gtceu:white_dwarf_spectrograph"
			id: "1690A8B9854A540D"
			rewards: [{ id: "5EB7C9C9084AD0A2", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "17E6AA3C46EDDD1E", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "A Star's Core"
			x: 36.75d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["31F75527A44532C5"]
			description: ["Nothing like a spoonful of white dwarf could be lifted, or weigh what it does. Degenerate matter here is a recipe and no more."]
			icon: "gtceu:degenerate_harvester"
			id: "1E8A5BB17104BD14"
			rewards: [{ id: "396C09505277C033", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "71C868124FD38659", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Fiction, Mostly"
			x: 34.25d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3970BC63BB8C9A9F"]
			description: ["A sealed &6Degenerate Pellet&r is a fuel that never runs out in your lifetime. The Degenerate Works presses it from degenerate matter and an exotic matter cell, and the gate's hold is run on it."]
			icon: "grindless:degenerate_pellet"
			id: "129CFFFDA25F22DC"
			rewards: [{ id: "1A85DDA17FFA905E", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5B0062FA700532F6", item: "grindless:degenerate_pellet", type: "item" }]
			title: "A White Dwarf in a Bottle"
			x: 41.5d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["129CFFFDA25F22DC", "31927D93FA5DAFEE"]
			description: ["The Warp Gate was built for UHV. At the UEV load it runs on a circuit 3 program and takes its power from the UEV wireless network. Your fuel is in the pellets and your power is in the cell."]
			icon: "gtceu:warp_gate"
			id: "7A1656F88B1FC86E"
			rewards: [{ id: "3E429B56B669129F", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "52F6D25AF9758F01", item: "gtceu:warp_gate", type: "item" }]
			title: "The Gate at UEV"
			x: 48.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7A1656F88B1FC86E", "5E61CE1D2B9B4F60", "7AD63131D4FD4BBF"]
			description: [
				"Hold the Warp Gate open at the UEV load in Sirius B orbit. Its input takes a tennessine sample, a degenerate pellet, a degenerate EOS model, four UEV circuits of any kind and circuit 3. The hold makes nothing: you tick this box when it has run."
				"The next casing is built apart: the UIV Machine Casing line is researched with the Pulsar Navigation Chart and takes UEV casings, field generators and emitters."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "gtceu:warp_gate"
			id: "5316E435F8496672"
			rewards: [{ id: "1AD75918C40B7B8D", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "diamond"
			size: 1.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "1368294E2B9C8317", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Gate to UIV"
			x: 51.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B6FD0C43D93BA99"]
			description: ["The workhorse of the age: a silicon carbide composite shell light and hard enough to wall a structure the size of a hangar. Nearly every UEV controller uses it; the Superheavy Factory alone takes about 1,400. An assembler: 16 SiC/SiC plates from the CVI Furnace, 8 SiC fibre preforms, 8 six-nines tantalum and a little epoxy, for two casings. The body of every UEV structure, and the base the other five casings are built beside. Stock plates, preforms and tantalum by ME and let a pattern provider run the assembler: you need hundreds, so build it a dedicated line."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:sic_composite_casing"
			id: "174EA7FB5DF07C5E"
			rewards: [{ id: "1E31D67941944DEF", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 64L, id: "7817E043AF4EFF62", item: "grindless:sic_composite_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "SiC Composite Casing"
			x: 44.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["174EA7FB5DF07C5E", "1128B01901C86B97", "5E8BE7618AF5F077"]
			description: ["A casing wound with lanthanum superhydride cable, which carries current with no loss while pressed. It holds the field of a calutron, the Superheavy Factory and the Degenerate Works. The naquadria magnet works, circuit 11: 64 lanthanum superhydride single wires, 16 SiC/SiC plates and a UEV sensor, for sixteen casings. Structures that bend or hold a beam: the Calutron (about 330), the Superheavy Factory (about 580), the Degenerate Works (about 500) and the Mk4 reactor (about 260). The superhydride wire is the bottleneck; keep the Megabar Press busy and send wire to the works by ME."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:superhydride_magnet_casing"
			id: "3A0B7D2A0307461B"
			rewards: [{ id: "32CE01D3B6FDFC1E", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 32L, id: "5FBB50C33AC653BC", item: "grindless:superhydride_magnet_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "Superhydride Magnet Casing"
			x: 47.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["174EA7FB5DF07C5E", "7B6FD0C43D93BA99"]
			description: ["A casing of ultra-low-expansion glass and hollow-core fibre that keeps a structure optically still. The photonic machines are built from it. An assembler: 16 ULE boules, 8 hollow-core fibres, 8 SiC mirror blanks, two UHV emitters and a little epoxy, for sixteen casings. The Photonic Integration Hall (its largest user), the SNSPD Foundry, the Van der Waals Stacker and the quantum, nebula and pulsar machines. One assembler run makes sixteen, so a single line usually covers a whole structure."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:photonic_casing"
			id: "14A81463D1669429"
			rewards: [{ id: "32ADCD4EE0D950ED", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 64L, id: "7334377268E08B8F", item: "grindless:photonic_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "Photonic Casing"
			x: 51.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["174EA7FB5DF07C5E", "76EFA041DAC4B333"]
			description: ["A lining of hafnium tantalum carbonitride, the most heat-resistant ceramic known, for the hot structures. A spark plasma sinterer, circuit 20: 20 HfTaCN powders, 4 SiC/SiC plates and 2 YSZ ingots, for two casings. The Stellar Forge (about 750), the Mk4 reactor (about 460), the Electron Beam Furnace (about 435), the Megabar Press (about 410) and the Calutron (about 200). Powder and plates by ME; the sintering takes time, so run more than one sinterer."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:hftacn_lining_casing"
			id: "561F192A5F2BDACC"
			rewards: [{ id: "3CA0B008EE88CF47", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 64L, id: "528D90E5A9E5ADE4", item: "grindless:hftacn_lining_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "HfTaCN Lining Casing"
			x: 54.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["174EA7FB5DF07C5E", "3970BC63BB8C9A9F"]
			description: ["The casing that stops degenerate matter, which would otherwise expand, from reaching anything else. It lines the Degenerate Works. An assembler: 64 SiC/SiC plates, 32 hollow-core fibres, 8 UEV sensors and a little epoxy, for sixty-four casings. The Degenerate Works, whose recipes are the only ones that bottle degenerate matter into pellets. A single run makes sixty-four; the sensors are the costly input, so build it only when the works is ready to be placed."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:degenerate_containment_casing"
			id: "5EFEF0A016A69EFB"
			rewards: [{ id: "1A806EB737D33779", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 64L, id: "7BDC19A2D4C71591", item: "grindless:degenerate_containment_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "Degenerate Containment Casing"
			x: 44.0d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["174EA7FB5DF07C5E", "76EFA041DAC4B333", "19174331BF47A9B1"]
			description: ["The ring casing of the Mk4 Fusion Reactor. It is an upgraded Mk3 casing that can bear Mk4 plasma. An assembler: a Mk3 fusion casing, 2 Wf/W tiles, a SiC/SiC plate and tritanium, for one casing. The Mk4 Fusion Reactor, which takes about 400 of them in its ring. Make them one at a time from existing Mk3 casings; the reactor is the only machine that needs them."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
