		{
			dependencies: ["19174331BF47A9B1"]
			description: ["The &6UEV Circuit Assembler&r is the assembler that builds the circuits of the next tier and the controllers around them. A UEV hull, a UEV robot arm, emitter and conveyor module, red alloy cable and one circuit, in a shaped crafting recipe. Circuit assembly at this tier. Boards and chips arrive from the cleanroom by ME; keep a small stock of what it returns."]
			icon: "gtceu:uev_circuit_assembler"
