		{
			dependencies: ["5FBB5CC4F79C7D79", "5C32C3BBED862564"]
			description: ["The &6UEV Parts&r are the emitter, sensor, robot arm, conveyor module, pump, piston and motor of this era. Every UEV machine, hatch and the UEV hull are built from them. The UHV part of the same kind (two for the emitter and sensor) with SNSPDs, quantum dot sources, graphene modulator, graphene and boron nitride films and six-nines metals; the motor takes bonded magnets, superhydride cable, SiC/SiC plates and FFKM seals. They are made in assemblers. The UEV field generator, the UEV hull and the UEV machines. Stock each part by ME; a machine draws several of the same kind."]
			icon: "gtceu:uev_emitter"
			id: "3E4117575EE79C34"
			rewards: [{ id: "1BF069F34D9673A8", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
