		{
			dependencies: ["19174331BF47A9B1", "3E4117575EE79C34"]
			description: ["The &6Ultimate Parallel Control Hatch&r lets a mega machine run up to 4,096 copies of a recipe at once. Energy is still the limit: every copy pays its own EU/t. A UEV hull, a UEV sensor, two UEV emitters, four UEV circuits of any kind, two superhydride double cables and a neutronium gear, on an assembly line researched with the UEV emitter. The Stellar Forge at full width, and every mega machine of the era. Feed the machine a bus wide enough for the copies it will run."]
			icon: "gtceu:uev_parallel_hatch"
			id: "3CE8ED7227C70D82"
			rewards: [{ id: "37FEEAB9B356500E", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
