			y: 10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5304F9E360A95261", "7B8852855265F1E3", "58C1564694482EBE"]
			description: ["Move your towers onto &6UEV SMES Cells&r and the wireless network carries UEV to every station, out to Alpha Centauri and beyond. A UEV Energy Hatch, a UEV sensor, two UEV circuits of any kind and a quantum repeater node for each wireless hatch, and one formed tower holding a UEV cell: the network runs at its strongest cell, so until then it stays at UHV. The repeater node also goes into the wireless covers. The wireless hatches at UEV, and the gate's load at Sirius B. Add cells when the network dips at your busiest hour."]
			icon: "gtceu:uev_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "31927D93FA5DAFEE"
