			]
			title: "The Network Goes UEV"
			x: 46.25d
			y: 0.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["31927D93FA5DAFEE"]
			description: ["The gate to UIV draws far more than one ring makes, and the bank loses a little on the way in. Add Mk4 rings and the swarm stations at Alpha Centauri until the bank holds through a whole hold."]
