		{
			dependencies: ["74B8B99C87A3BABC"]
			description: ["The &6Thruster Works&r makes the Direct Fusion Drive Mk1 and Mk2, the motors of level 9 and level 10 rockets. Mk1: Wf/W tiles, SiC/SiC plates, HfTaCN ingots, D-He3 fuel mix, a UEV emitter and a circuit 6 program. Mk2: a Mk1 motor, a Brayton turbine wheel, eight bonded magnets, a UEV motor and a circuit 7 program. Level 9 and level 10 rockets. Motors go to ME; the Mk2 wheels come from the Single-Crystal Foundry."]
			icon: "gtceu:thruster_works"
			id: "3DDE5C2C942D2B01"
			rewards: [{ id: "17F86E5D5D05AA88", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
