		{
			dependencies: ["32730EE4F1B2A321"]
			description: ["Barnard b has no gate of its own. It is fed from the Alpha Centauri relay by the same mechanism that served Proxima b, and the carbonyl refinery takes carbon monoxide from the HV syngas plant over it."]
