		{
			dependencies: ["37BBAC4FC45216FC"]
			description: ["The &6Swarm Control Station&r and &6Solar Probe Bay&r take an Alpha Centauri A row, and the &6Warp Gate&r takes relay pairs and a heavier load. Segments and probes at Alpha Centauri, and the stations built above. Swarm power at a second star and the gate's load for UIV. Segments and probes ride the relay; keep the bank sized for the gate's hold."]
