		{
			dependencies: ["1BE00654ED22DDB6"]
			description: ["The &6Calutron&r bends a beam of ions in a magnet, and each isotope lands in its own cup. Two UHV hulls, three UV sensors, three UV field generators, three SRF cryomodules, a Nb3Sn cavity, two zircaloy tubes, any UHV circuit and the stable casing. Calcium-48 and plutonium-244, the bullet and the target of every superheavy run. Feed the ore dust by ME and send each isotope to its own chest; the rest returns for another pass."]
