		{
			dependencies: ["79361740BE1544E3"]
			description: ["The &6Superheavy Factory&r accelerates calcium-48 until it can fuse with a plutonium target, then picks the few new atoms out of the beam on the same line. Four UHV hulls, eight UV sensors, seven UV field generators, fifteen UHV circuits, seven calcium-48 beams, three target wheels, three Nb3Sn cavities, fifteen polycarbonate foils and the stable casing; the Calutron is its research. A very large structure (31x11x47), and GTM's Terminal places it in three passes. Irradiation and recoil separation in one machine: counted atoms of flerovium and heavier, ready for the chemistry lab. Beam, target, membranes and foils arrive by ME; sort the few atoms by element."]
			icon: "gtceu:heavy_ion_cyclotron"
			id: "5BA764E947B7B979"
