		{
			dependencies: ["1BE00654ED22DDB6"]
			description: ["The &6Electron Beam Furnace&r melts metal in a vacuum with a beam, so it comes out purer than a coil could make it. Two UHV hulls, four UV emitters, eight UHV circuits, four SRF cryomodules, eight SRF cavities, three near-net neutronium gears and the clean casing. Six-nines hafnium and tantalum for the single-crystal foundry. Feed bars by ME; the vacuum pump has a hatch of its own."]
