		{
			dependencies: ["34F0084064B3AF4F"]
			description: ["The &6CVI Furnace&r fills a woven preform with gas that deposits carbide in the gaps. Four UHV hulls, eleven UHV pumps, ten UHV emitters and sensors each, fourteen UHV circuits, four SiC preforms, four tungsten preforms, three FFKM seals and the heatproof casing; the SiC Fibre Plant is its research. SiC composite plates, and the HfTaCN coil that the stellar forge uses. Preforms arrive by ME; the cycle is long, so run several furnaces."]
