		{
			dependencies: ["76EFA041DAC4B333", "19174331BF47A9B1"]
			description: ["The &6Stellar Forge&r is a furnace that holds a fragment of a star. A UEV hull, eleven electric blast furnaces, twenty-three HfTaCN coil blocks, four UEV field generators, five UEV pumps, three UEV sensors, three ULE cavities, three HfTaCN heating elements and six UEV circuits. It is a large structure (15x23x15): GTM's Terminal places about 2,300 per pass and this one takes two. The hottest recipes in the pack, which the Mk4 plasma line runs on. Fuel and heat sinks by ME; plan for the byproducts before you start."]
