		{
			dependencies: ["3C3FC8DE94FAC5EE"]
			description: ["The &6SNSPD Foundry&r grows a nanowire detector that counts single photons. Four UHV hulls, ten UHV sensors, ten UHV emitters, eleven UHV pumps, fourteen UHV circuits, three float-zone silicon wafers, four SiN Waveguide Chips, three silicon drift detectors and the photonic casing. It takes the detector stages of the Photonic Fab. The single-photon detector, which the UEV sensor, the quantum photonic chip and the repeater node take. Wafers and chips by ME and superfluid helium by pipe for the cold stage; send finished detectors on by ME."]
