			description: ["The &6Photonic Integration Hall&r bonds waveguides, sources and detectors into one optical chip. Five UHV hulls, thirteen UHV emitters, thirteen sensors, thirteen motors, seventeen UHV circuits, four quantum dot sources, four graphene modulators, five SiN Waveguide Chips and the photonic casing; the Van der Waals Stacker is its research. It is a large structure (23x11x23): GTM's Terminal places about 2,300 per pass and this one takes two. The waveguide circuit, the quantum photonic chip and the optical computer. Parts in matched counts by ME; keep a stock of finished chips and send them to the assembler."]
