			description: ["The &6Mk4 Fusion Reactor&r is a ring that burns polarised helium-3 and deuterium into the most energy a reactor makes. A UEV hull, five UEV emitters, four UEV sensors, four UEV field generators, nine UEV circuits, two UEV fusion casings, two HfTaCN coil blocks and a Wf/W tile; the Helium-3 Polariser is its research. It is a large structure (33x9x33) and GTM's Terminal places about 2,300 per pass, so plan two. The plasma and burn quests that follow it. Fuel and coolant by pipe; build the plant before you light it."]
