		{
			dependencies: ["565457BFBC2B7232", "7AD63131D4FD4BBF"]
			description: ["The &6Degenerate Works&r takes matter from a white dwarf and bottles it into a pellet that can be carried safely. A UEV hull, five UEV arms, five pumps, three sensors, five emitters, three regulators, nine UEV circuits, an EOS model, a mass-radius chart, two hollow-core fibres, two Faraday isolators, two SPDC sources and the degenerate containment casing; the spectrograph is its research. It is a large structure (21x15x29), so GTM's Terminal places it in two passes. Degenerate matter, made in Sirius B orbit, which the same works bottles at once: it runs the degenerate containment recipes itself. Keep the plant behind a containment loop; never pipe this matter. Cells and pellets move by ME."]
